# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE DATA — never commit real dossiers, decisions, or your working copy
# to the public repo. These hold candid notes about real people. Local only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Your private working copy (the live install seeded by /onboard).
# Keep it OUTSIDE this repo (e.g. ~/pgmanaiger-working/). If you ever nest it
# here, this ignores it. Also ignore the common explicit names:
pgmanaiger-working/
working-copy/

# Live working files if you run the rituals inside this repo instead of a
# separate working copy (not recommended, but protected just in case):
Memory/
Daily Notes/
Meetings/
Task Board.md
Scratchpad.md
Accomplishments.md
assistant-config.md

# All real dossiers / decisions...
people/*
boss/*
decisions/*

# ...EXCEPT the placeholders and folder READMEs, so the repo still ships a
# usable, navigable skeleton. (Filled-in EXAMPLES live in examples/, which is
# fictional and fully tracked.)
!people/README.md
!boss/.gitkeep
!boss/README.md
!decisions/.gitkeep
!decisions/README.md

# Common local cruft
.DS_Store
*.local.md
